    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joashi waandza kutawala Juda, mwaka wa sabaa wa utawala wa mfalume Jehu, na watawala miaka mirongo mine. Watawala kula Jerusalemu, na dzina ra nine kala aihwa Zibiya wa mudzi Beeri-Sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Joashi wahenda garigo sawa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, kpwa mana mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada kala achimfundza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kuabudira tamuyauswa, na atu achikala anaenderera kulavya sadaka na kufukiza uvumba mumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 30:11–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Joashi waambira alavyadzi-sadaka, “Kusanyani feza zosi za vitu vitakatifu zirehwazo kpwa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, feza za atu kulengana na chiwango cha chila mmwenga choikirwa, feza za kuusa naziri na feza zirehwazo ni atu kulengana na mioyo yao inavyoahuma arehe kpwa nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alavyadzi-sadaka ni azihale, chila mmwenga kula kpwa hara anao amanya, nao andazirekebishira nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, murimo bomoka, na chila yedzapho shida ya dzengo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hata kufikira miaka mirongo miiri na mihahu ya utawala wa Joashi, alavyadzi-sadaka akala bado kurekebisha myanya ya yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mfalume Joashi waiha mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada na alavyadzi-sadaka anjina na achiauza, “Mbona tamuirekebisha myanya ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu? Phahi, msiphokere tsona feza kula kpwa atu, ela zilavyeni ili nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu irekebishwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alavyadzi-sadaka akubali kukala asiphokere tsona feza kula kpwa atu. Na wala asirekebishe myanya ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoyada wahala sanduku na achiombola tundu kpwenye chifwinikoche, chisha wariika phephi na phatu pha kulavira sadaka uphande wa kulume, mutu anaphoinjira ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nao alavyadzi-sadaka ariokala anarinda mryango, aika ndani ya sanduku feza zosi zirizorehwa ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mara ariphoona kukala kuna feza nyinji ndani ya sanduku, muandishi wa mfalume na mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu ainjira na kuolanga feza yosi iriyophahikana ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuzifunga mifukoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphomala kuziolanga azilavya mikononi mwa atu arioimirira kazi ya kurekebisha nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nyo aimirizi nao kala achiaripha atu okala achirekebisha nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, maseremala, mafundi ga kudzenga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mafundi a kudzenga na mawe na atsongadzi a mawe. Tsona zahumirwa kpwa kugula mbao na mawe ga kutsongbwa na kuriphira garama zanjina zosi zokala zinahusiana na kurekebishira yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela feza hizo taziyahumika kpwa kuriphira kazi za kutengeza mabeseni ga feza, makasi ga kukata tambi za mishumaa, mabakuli, magunda, wala kpwa miyo yanjina yoyosi ya zahabu au ya feza kahi ya Nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa sababu hiyo, feza zosi zahewa ahendadzi-kazi ariozihumira kurekebishira nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.22.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 22:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimirizi a kazi iyo akala aaminifu kabisa. Kpwa hivyo takuyakala na lazima ya kualonda alavye isabu ya mahumizi ga feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 7:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela feza za sadaka za maripho ga kuusa makosa na za sadaka za kuusa dambi taziyainjizwa ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Hizo zakala ni za alavyadzi-sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
