      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu waambuka kpwendapiga mudzi wa Gathi, na achiuhala mateka. Bada ya higo Hazaeli waelekeya Jerusalemu ili aushambuliye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joashi mfalume wa Juda wahala vitu vyosi vyotengbwa ni afalume ariomtanguliya kutawala Juda, Jehoshafati, Jehoramu na Ahaziya, na achienjereza na vyakpwe vyokala vikatengbwa ni akaree, phamwenga na zahabu yosi yokala kpwenye hazina ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, na ndani ya dzumba ra mfalume, achizihuma kpwa Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu. Naye Hazaeli achiuka Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambo ganjina ga Joashi na gosi arigohenda gaandikpwa kpwenye Chitabu cha Mambo ga Nyakati za Afalume a Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumishie amuhendera njama na achimuolaga kpwenye nyumba ya Milo kpwenye barabara iphiyayo Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariompiga na kumuolaga ni atumishie, Jozakari mwana wa Shimeathi na Jehozabadi mwana wa Shomeri. Halafu achimzika kpwenye vikura vya afalume kpwenye mudzi wa Daudi. Naye Amaziya mwanawe watawala badalaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
